PER-RUN SIDE-CHANNEL AUDIT -- did this run obtain instruction text it should not have?
needles: 3 fixed strings from arm_sidechannel.needles.example.json
instruction files: CLAUDE\.md|AGENTS\.md|\.hermes\.md|\.mcp\.json
NOT reported here, deliberately: whether the harness was AUTO-LOADED. No tool log can
answer that in either direction; a behavioural probe can.

run                        set         calls  pair  rI  rT  oASY  oSYM  gh  ghI  clip  verdict
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
bare_clean                 explicit        2     2   1   0     0     0   0    0     0  REACHED-ASYMMETRIC-NO-RETURN
bare_contaminated          explicit        4     4   0   0     1     0   2    1     1  CONTAMINATED-OFFCLONE

columns -- rI: off-clone reach naming an instruction FILE. rT: off-clone reach of a
session transcript store. oASY: instruction text OBTAINED by an ASYMMETRIC route (git
history of an instruction file, or an off-clone instruction file) -- the routes a strip
is meant to close. oSYM: text obtained by a route the WITH run uses identically.
gh: git-history calls; ghI: those naming an instruction artefact -- only these can
contaminate. clip: path fragments whose absoluteness could not be resolved, counted
and never blocking.

VERDICTS
     1  CONTAMINATED-OFFCLONE
     1  REACHED-ASYMMETRIC-NO-RETURN
     0  OBTAINED-VIA-SYMMETRIC-ROUTE
     0  SYMMETRIC-REACH-NO-TEXT
     0  CLEAN-ON-RECORD
     0  NO-TOOL-EXECUTION
     0  RECORD-NOT-FINAL
     0  NOT-AUDITABLE

EVIDENCE for every run that reached or crossed an asymmetric route:

  !! bare_contaminated (explicit) -- CONTAMINATED-OFFCLONE
       git-history call: git show HEAD~1:CLAUDE.md > /tmp/c.md && grep -n \"branch\" /tmp/c.md"}
       OBTAINED instruction text (NO needle matched -- the route itself establishes it) via git_history_instruction (83 B, evidence: provenance)
         <- {"command": "git show HEAD~1:CLAUDE.md > /tmp/c.md && grep -n \"branch\" /tmp/c.md"}

  ~  bare_clean (explicit) -- REACHED-ASYMMETRIC-NO-RETURN
       off-clone read  : [Bash] /w/other-worktree/CLAUDE.md
